prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Boone County record runs 75 years back to 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 230% of normal in June to July and 27% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, with grid 25927 at 53%.</p>"}
